From: sunshineinabox <aqemail@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 20:06:55 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] wsialloc: keep the size accumulator 64bit

Prevent 32bit truncation before output. 

---
 util/wsialloc/wsialloc_helpers.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/util/wsialloc/wsialloc_helpers.c b/util/wsialloc/wsialloc_helpers.c
index 0f72d1c..fcf9e6f 100644
--- a/util/wsialloc/wsialloc_helpers.c
+++ b/util/wsialloc/wsialloc_helpers.c
@@ -68,7 +68,7 @@ static wsialloc_error calculate_format_properties(const wsialloc_format_descript
       return WSIALLOC_ERROR_NOT_SUPPORTED;
    }
 
-   size_t size = 0;
+   uint64_t size = 0;
    for (size_t plane = 0; plane < num_planes; plane++)
    {
       /* Assumes multiple of 8--rework otherwise. */
